  "body": "Skip the Wait & Build Now\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Orewa's most desirable pockets, this elevated 450sqm freehold section (more or less) offers an opportunity for home builders, developers, or investors.\r\n\r\nBoth Resource Consent (RC) and Building Consent (BC) are officially approved, saving you significant time and holding costs.\r\n\r\nReady to build the pre-approved, well-designed dream home: Construction of one three-storey detached dwelling, 6 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, with open living, dining, family, and double garage.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of coastal living. It's zoned and just a short stroll from Orewa Primary School, moments from Orewa College, and minutes away from Orewa Beach, vibrant cafes, shops, and easy access to the motorway.\r\n\r\nCall today to receive the full consent package and plan details!\r\n\r\n*Purchase price plus GST (if any)",
